Package: bitwardensync
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6
Maintainer: Matthew Daubney <matt@daubney.dev>
Description: Sync secrets from Bitwarden into a HashiCorp Vault KV v2 store
 One-way sync tool that reads items out of a Bitwarden vault and writes
 them into a HashiCorp Vault KV v2 secrets engine.
 .
 Ships as a fully self-contained package: a bundled Python 3.13 runtime
 and all dependencies live under /opt/bitwardensync, so no system Python
 or package versions are required. Configuration is via environment
 variables; see /usr/share/doc/bitwardensync/env.example.
